<speak>Yes, I am willing to accept investment losses and realise a loss on this sale. I still want to control the execution price. Thank you for not rushing the questions together. I prefer that style of conversation. At work, people sometimes begin their next sentence before I have finished answering the first one, and then we both have to stop and start again. There is no ill intention; everyone is trying to be efficient. But I find a slightly slower conversation often takes less effort in the end.</speak>